            "sid": "1KI 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu akunyuzayejima akudi anyanta ankanu ejima ahamaseki, atiyilaŋa mpuhu yamaana indi, hiyakwinzaŋa nakutiya maana aSolomoni.",
          "type": "text",
